{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600160","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1360016001:2":{"text":"“逐夜”当晚，你们齐聚一堂，在女神像下，与圣石镇的居民们迎接“开阳”的到来。","source_cn":"“逐夜”当晚，你们齐聚一堂，在女神像下，与圣石镇的居民...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5F5D17C430CF99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360016002:0":{"text":"还以为会错过你们呢，老朋友。","source_cn":"还以为会错过你们呢，老朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82EFB2D285FDD100","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360016003:1":{"text":"你还不了解主人吗，将军！无论什么节日，<male>他</male><female>她</female>都会回来过的！","source_cn":"你还不了解主人吗，将军！无论什么节日，<male>他<...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CB7E718163F8A3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你还不了解主人吗，将军！无论什么节日，<male>他</male><female>她</female>都会回来过的！","female":"你还不了解主人吗，将军！无论什么节日，<male>他</male><female>她</female>都会回来过的！","variant_male_record_index":"153094","variant_female_record_index":"153095","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360016004:1":{"text":"而且还经常会为我们带来一些新朋友，哈哈哈哈。","source_cn":"而且还经常会为我们带来一些新朋友，哈哈哈哈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8198AF75D70D3569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360016005:0":{"text":"我已经准备好给大家带来晨曦的焰光了。","source_cn":"我已经准备好给大家带来晨曦的焰光了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x172C88D4EAD7AABC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360016006:1":{"text":"啊，快到时间了！大家，准备倒计时！","source_cn":"啊，快到时间了！大家，准备倒计时！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9388F46C9532700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360016007:0":{"text":"5、4、3、2、1——","source_cn":"5、4、3、2、1——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7B130A31AF1B8CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1360016008:1":{"text":"在倒计时结束的瞬间，一道绚丽无比的流光居然抢在塔琳之前，率先划破了天宇——","source_cn":"在倒计时结束的瞬间，一道绚丽无比的流光居然抢在塔琳之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9059BD57D27B5229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1360016009:1":{"text":"那是萨基塔里斯的长矛？！居然被他抢先了！那个爱出风头的家伙！","source_cn":"那是萨基塔里斯的长矛？！居然被他抢先了！那个爱出风头的家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x447311768B16E4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360016010:1":{"text":"塔琳不甘示弱，下一秒，无比鲜艳的华美火焰盘旋破空而上……","source_cn":"塔琳不甘示弱，下一秒，无比鲜艳的华美火焰盘旋破空而上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885E967729B9DF8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1360016011:1":{"text":"随即，在大家的欢呼声中，烟火燃起——","source_cn":"随即，在大家的欢呼声中，烟火燃起——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB27CA99E2C848E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1360016012:0":{"text":"开阳之时，到了！","source_cn":"开阳之时，到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD86A123D7D38EA53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1360016013:1":{"text":"哈哈哈哈，我的大烟花就是不一样！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，我的大烟花就是不一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x820CB2B13A90F1E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1360016014:1":{"text":"春焰庆快乐啊，呼金大人！","source_cn":"春焰庆快乐啊，呼金大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF29879A14CBAA1AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1360016015:1":{"text":"点起灯来，庆祝开阳！","source_cn":"点起灯来，庆祝开阳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x857DD80CA3C0A11A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1360016016:1":{"text":"春焰庆开始了！","source_cn":"春焰庆开始了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1B12844231D757F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1360016017:0":{"text":"春焰庆快乐！孩子们！","source_cn":"春焰庆快乐！孩子们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D76E5ADAE01FAA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1360016018:1":{"text":"今年的烟花真是与众不同啊。","source_cn":"今年的烟花真是与众不同啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4916DAC29080661","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1360016019:0":{"text":"别愣着，你们这帮笨蛋，继续上啊！","source_cn":"别愣着，你们这帮笨蛋，继续上啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E499DEBB4929D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1360016020:1":{"text":"现在黑嚎部族的战士暂时处于劣势——","source_cn":"现在黑嚎部族的战士暂时处于劣势——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33FD954BC7386A30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1360016021:1":{"text":"好漂亮，噜噜要画好多画！","source_cn":"好漂亮，噜噜要画好多画！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05553E6839B10B6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1360016022:1":{"text":"嘿嘿，好看吧？这次的烟火可有我的功劳！","source_cn":"嘿嘿，好看吧？这次的烟火可有我的功劳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E5A63F99A82E425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1360016023:1":{"text":"哼，还挺漂亮的嘛，不知道特弥希娅那家伙现在在干什么……","source_cn":"哼，还挺漂亮的嘛，不知道特弥希娅那家伙现在在干什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6316A965FB6E8E2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1360016024:1":{"text":"爷爷，奶奶，放烟花了，快出来看！","source_cn":"爷爷，奶奶，放烟花了，快出来看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34357ACF5244E059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1360016025:0":{"text":"呵呵，真是热闹啊。","source_cn":"呵呵，真是热闹啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0B8311B412982C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1360016026:0":{"text":"春焰庆正式开始了——春焰庆快乐啊，各位！","source_cn":"春焰庆正式开始了——春焰庆快乐啊，各位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB407E7397C9346D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1360016027:1":{"text":"春焰庆快乐！","source_cn":"春焰庆快乐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC44CC1E6379B3A02","variant_status":"",